# Deep SORT: TensorFlow → PyTorch appearance model

Use this rule when replacing TensorFlow with PyTorch or touching feature extraction code.

## High-level migration plan

1. Implement a PyTorch appearance model that outputs 128-D embeddings.
2. Integrate it into `tools/generate_detections.py`.
3. Remove TensorFlow dependencies only after PyTorch parity is acceptable.
4. Keep the tracker itself framework-agnostic (NumPy-only).

---

